<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz unit sets 100 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz unit sets 100 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up bond was announced by joint lead managers Kredietbank Bankverein.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ FINANCE BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ GZ</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.0	MATURITY    01.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.88    PAY DATE    01.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	REOFFER    99.88     LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS, THEN STEPS UP TO 6.75 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  2.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	 SSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
